      "id": "#/texts/9",
      "section": "Post Job Information",
      "text": "Mix 14 sks of Thermolite cement with 60 gallons of fresh water (13.5 ppg) and additives. Pump 10 sack volume at .5 bpm. Initial pump pressure to 170 psi, fall back to 100. Wait 10 min. Pump 2 sks volume, pressure to 150 psi. Shut in side valve. Clean pump and discharge hoses. Set grab sample in water bath at 180 F.",
